prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Plaintiff most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Pass a decree of ejectment / eviction directing the Defendant to vacate and deliver vacant and peaceful possession of the suit premises described in the Schedule to the Plaintiff;

b) Pass a decree for recovery of arrears of rent of Rs. {rent_arrears}/- from {arrears_from} to the date of termination of tenancy;

c) Direct the Defendant to pay mesne profits / damages for wrongful use and occupation at the rate of Rs. ____/- per month from the date of termination of tenancy till delivery of vacant possession to the Plaintiff;

d) Award future interest at the rate of 12% per annum on the decretal sums u/s 34 CPC;

e) Award costs of the suit in favour of the Plaintiff;

f) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper.

And for this act of kindness, the Plaintiff shall ever pray.
